setup-bun 复合动作的 Install dependencies 步骤新增 skip-env 变量
（ELECTRON_SKIP_BINARY_DOWNLOAD/PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD/HUSKY 等），
与 build-opencode.yml Windows 步骤保持一致，跳过 CI 不需要的 electron/playwright/
puppeteer/cypress 预构建二进制下载与 husky hook 安装。upstream-e2e 的 playwright
浏览器由 test.yml 独立步骤安装，且 step 级 env 不跨步骤持久化，不受影响；
native postinstall（node-pty/tree-sitter 等）不读取这些变量，照常编译。

ghostty-web 依赖从 github:anomalyco/ghostty-web#main（浮动分支引用）pin 到不可变
commit 513463a，消除上游 main 推送导致的 bun.lock 反复改写与重新下载。pin 锁定的
是改动前已解析的同一 commit，行为零变化。

diff --git a/.github/actions/setup-bun/action.yml b/.github/actions/setup-bun/action.yml
index d30e4965f15bcbc9ea71386b71669e6c5a6dfef2..33632c32878ffc8075038b62a143173af635e37a 100644
--- a/.github/actions/setup-bun/action.yml
+++ b/.github/actions/setup-bun/action.yml
@@ -47,6 +47,22 @@ runs:
       shell: bash
 
     - name: Install dependencies
+      env:
+        # CI 无需 electron/playwright/puppeteer/cypress 的预构建二进制：
+        # opencode/core/http-recorder 单测不依赖它们；upstream-e2e 的 playwright
+        # 浏览器由 test.yml 的独立步骤安装（PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD 仅抑制
+        # bun install 的 postinstall 自动下载，不影响后续 `playwright install` CLI）。
+        # 与 build-opencode.yml 的 Windows install 步骤保持一致。
+        # 注意：electron 的 install.js 实际检查 ELECTRON_SKIP_BINARY_DOWNLOAD（另一个
+        # ELECTRON_SKIP_DOWNLOAD 供 electron-builder 等工具识别，两者都设以对齐先例）。
+        ELECTRON_SKIP_BINARY_DOWNLOAD: "1"
+        ELECTRON_SKIP_DOWNLOAD: "1"
+        PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD: "1"
+        PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD: "1"
+        CYPRESS_INSTALL_BINARY: "0"
+        # CI 不提交代码，无需 husky 安装 git hook；HUSKY=0 让 husky 9 直接 return（exit 0）。
+        # 测试中的 git commit 均在 os.tmpdir() 的独立 repo 中执行，不读取根 .husky/，互不影响。
+        HUSKY: "0"
       run: |
         # Workaround for patched peer variants
         # e.g. ./patches/ for standard-openapi
diff --git a/bun.lock b/bun.lock
index 40bfd590fe85ead6d0902fb01f0c29804d71b270..5a5f4146bd855b5f8ae5234478dad14da58ee036 100644
--- a/bun.lock
+++ b/bun.lock
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@
         "diff": "catalog:",
         "effect": "catalog:",
         "fuzzysort": "catalog:",
-        "ghostty-web": "github:anomalyco/ghostty-web#main",
+        "ghostty-web": "github:anomalyco/ghostty-web#513463a6f1190253057e8a3f0dac8f6ee8393553",
         "luxon": "catalog:",
         "marked": "catalog:",
         "marked-shiki": "catalog:",
diff --git a/packages/app/package.json b/packages/app/package.json
index a4d6bb59db8cc01cadedb2bd9641f45f294ec40f..3438cdd58f7674391acb2f861c67efedb57628e0 100644
--- a/packages/app/package.json
+++ b/packages/app/package.json
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@
     "diff": "catalog:",
     "effect": "catalog:",
     "fuzzysort": "catalog:",
-    "ghostty-web": "github:anomalyco/ghostty-web#main",
+    "ghostty-web": "github:anomalyco/ghostty-web#513463a6f1190253057e8a3f0dac8f6ee8393553",
     "luxon": "catalog:",
     "marked": "catalog:",
     "marked-shiki": "catalog:",
